@baseUrl = https://localhost:7007/identity

### Login As Manager
POST {{baseUrl}}/token/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "pm@localhost",
    "password": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_PASSWORD"
}

### Login As Labor
