### Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/token/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ExpiredAccessToken": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_TOKEN",
    "refreshToken": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_TOKEN"
}
